  "duration_s": 496.257846,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上最有文人气的名楼是哪一座吗？有人说是滕王阁，王勃二十岁出头，写了篇七百多字的文章，直接火了一千多年。有人说是黄鹤楼，李白去了都只能叹气，放下笔，引得后来的文人墨客写了一千多首诗，错滕王阁连前两名都进不去。黄鹤楼也不是第一，真正排在榜首的那座楼名弃天下皆知，但给他写下千古名篇的那位大文人，一辈子，连他的楼梯都没踩过一步。他隔着几百里山水，只凭手上一张画一封信，就把一座遭贬官员翻修的普通城楼写成了天下读书人千年不变的硬骨头。今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上十大最有文人气的名楼。老规矩开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第十名，甲秀楼、贵州贵阳。如果光看名气，他在全国真不算最小，可要论边远地方的文人古气，他必须排在头。一个三层挑檐的大楼二十多米高，稳稳立在南明河正中间的一块大巨石上，四周全是回廊。四百多年前的明朝万历年间，巡抚江东之嫌，贵州太偏僻，当地读书人太少，特意在核心的大石头上盖的这座楼起名叫柯贾，挺秀，就是盼着自家地盘上也能考出治国的大才。结果娄刚建好不久，贵州破天荒考出了历史上第一位文状元。赵以炯彻底打破了西南边地出不了大文人的老说法。引得后来的读书人在上面刻了上百首诗，一座楼带，忘了一整省的文器。您说他算不算文人气象的第一块基石？第九名，望江楼，四川成都别的名楼写的都是士大夫升官治国，可这座楼里藏着的是一个才华，极高却一辈子命苦的女人。三十九米高整整四层，底下两层八个角，上面两层四个角，远远看过去全被一片绿油油的竹林包在里头。清代文人为了纪念女诗人薛涛，专门盖了这座楼薛涛一辈子最喜欢竹子。当年他在这里亲手做信纸，写了五百多首好诗，跟白居易他们一起写诗喝酒聊天，可他空有一肚子惊人的才学身份，却只是个身不由己的卖艺女子，到老也是守着满院子，竹子一个人凄凄凉凉活到死楼修的再好看，人早就没了，但性质上当年滴下的眼泪，到现在还让人揪心。这就是一代才女望不尽的委屈。第八名，太白楼，山东济宁全天下，纪念诗仙的地方数都数不清。但这一座楼记录了李白最狂也最接地气的二十多年。青砖灰瓦两层大屋顶，屋里宽敞的很，看似平平常常，底下枕着的可是京杭大运河的河水。当年李白在济宁安家落户，二十多年，天天泡在这家小酒楼，里端着大海碗喝酒喝高了。就在墙上狂写诗写下了整整五十多首好诗，后来街坊邻居干脆把这家饭馆改名叫太白楼，一千多年来，不知多少考不上功名，心里堵得慌的书生特意跑来打上一脚烈酒，靠着栏杆往前看，学李白的仙气，人走楼还在酒，喝完了诗还在能在柴米油盐的小酒铺里把胸膛挺向天地。您说这算不算最烈的？一抹文人？骨气，第七名，大观楼云南昆明，他就在滇池水边单看那两层木楼，其实算不上多宏大，但他凭着一个穷书生写的一幅字，硬生生撑起了天下第一长联三间宽的门面，紧挨着水面。盖四周全是柳树，清朝乾隆年间一辈子没考上官的穷书生。孙然翁走上楼，看着五百里滇池浪打浪，再回头想想千百年来历朝历代的兴衰变化，一口气在墙上写下一百八十个字的大长联前，半截写进了云南的大山，大水后半截把汉唐宋元那些大关将军的下场全说明白了。一个截的地峰应当想的布衣百姓，单凭手里一杆毛笔，文采，就压过了历代王爷大官的奉承画名字，只是大官，胸膛里却装得下几百年历史，这是何等的胸襟与做派。第六名，鹳雀楼，山西永济讲到这里，上级的分量就真正沉下来了。整整三层高楼七十多米，高高高高立在岸边，直冲冲盯着底下翻滚的黄河。一千三百多年前，唐代诗人王之涣爬上这座楼，看着天边的落日和滚滚黄河，只用了二十个大白话字，白日依山尽，黄河入海流，欲穷千里目，更上一层楼。就把中国文人登高望远的境界推到了顶峰。后来的几百年里，打仗的大火把，它烧成焦土，滔滔黄河水几回，把地基冲的稀烂。唐朝的那座老楼连块砖头都没剩下，可哪怕楼没了整整七百年，只要那二十个字还在，每一个中国人路过黄河边，脑子里就能立刻立起一座大唐的高楼。木头盖的楼早晚会烧毁，唯有文人写下的诗能在大地上活一万年。您说这算不算最硬的？文人一锤从第十到第六名，甲秀楼点醒了贵州的读书苗子。望江楼藏着才女一世的叹气，太白楼灌饱了李白满肚子的烈酒。大观楼用一百八十个字道破历史，鹳雀楼，哪怕被烧成焦土，依然用二十个字撑起大唐门面，可他们还不是最有文人气的。接下来第五道第一名更不寻常。有一座楼历史上被大火烧光，又重建了整整二十九次。王勃当年靠着柱子写下的绝唱，今天连一根旧木料都没留下。有一座江边，鼓楼引来几百位顶尖文豪，在大墙上斗了一千多年的诗，连李白都不敢轻易动笔。可排在榜首的那座写下千古名篇的大文豪，一辈子连他的门槛都没迈过，他是哪做？他凭什么能排在黄鹤楼和滕门阁的前头？下一集已经同步更新，现在直接点开我的头像，进入主页，第一条视频就是下一集点个关注，看看谁才是中国历史上最有文人气的名楼之首。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 4890,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上最有文人气的名楼是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5330,
      "end_ms": 6870,
      "text": "有人说是滕王阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7770,
      "end_ms": 9550,
      "text": "王勃二十岁出头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9730,
      "end_ms": 11590,
      "text": "写了篇七百多字的文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12010,
      "end_ms": 13750,
      "text": "直接火了一千多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14130,
      "end_ms": 15470,
      "text": "有人说是黄鹤楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16010,
      "end_ms": 17810,
      "text": "李白去了都只能叹气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17930,
      "end_ms": 18590,
      "text": "放下笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18950,
      "end_ms": 22050,
      "text": "引得后来的文人墨客写了一千多首诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22510,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "错滕王阁连前两名都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26330,
      "end_ms": 27750,
      "text": "黄鹤楼也不是第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28170,
      "end_ms": 32780,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那座楼名弃天下皆知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33260,
      "end_ms": 36380,
      "text": "但给他写下千古名篇的那位大文人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36660,
      "end_ms": 37440,
      "text": "一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37720,
      "end_ms": 40440,
      "text": "连他的楼梯都没踩过一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40840,
      "end_ms": 42540,
      "text": "他隔着几百里山水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43120,
      "end_ms": 45720,
      "text": "只凭手上一张画一封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46200,
      "end_ms": 53800,
      "text": "就把一座遭贬官员翻修的普通城楼写成了天下读书人千年不变的硬骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54220,
      "end_ms": 59615,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上十大最有文人气的名楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60290,
      "end_ms": 62300,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62440,
      "end_ms": 65065,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 65440,
      "end_ms": 67000,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67040,
      "end_ms": 68745,
      "text": "在听第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 69150,
      "end_ms": 71235,
      "text": "甲秀楼、贵州贵阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 71820,
      "end_ms": 73245,
      "text": "如果光看名气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 73620,
      "end_ms": 75735,
      "text": "他在全国真不算最小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76430,
      "end_ms": 79225,
      "text": "可要论边远地方的文人古气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79640,
      "end_ms": 80700,
      "text": "他必须排在头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80700,
      "end_ms": 85305,
      "text": "一个三层挑檐的大楼二十多米高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 86090,
      "end_ms": 90285,
      "text": "稳稳立在南明河正中间的一块大巨石上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 91080,
      "end_ms": 92575,
      "text": "四周全是回廊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 93000,
      "end_ms": 95295,
      "text": "四百多年前的明朝万历年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 96120,
      "end_ms": 98055,
      "text": "巡抚江东之嫌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 98510,
      "end_ms": 99695,
      "text": "贵州太偏僻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 100190,
      "end_ms": 101555,
      "text": "当地读书人太少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 102230,
      "end_ms": 107200,
      "text": "特意在核心的大石头上盖的这座楼起名叫柯贾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107220,
      "end_ms": 107865,
      "text": "挺秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108310,
      "end_ms": 112275,
      "text": "就是盼着自家地盘上也能考出治国的大才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 112760,
      "end_ms": 114275,
      "text": "结果娄刚建好不久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 114590,
      "end_ms": 118370,
      "text": "贵州破天荒考出了历史上第一位文状元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 118390,
      "end_ms": 123855,
      "text": "赵以炯彻底打破了西南边地出不了大文人的老说法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 124330,
      "end_ms": 127765,
      "text": "引得后来的读书人在上面刻了上百首诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 128240,
      "end_ms": 129260,
      "text": "一座楼带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129260,
      "end_ms": 131195,
      "text": "忘了一整省的文器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 131630,
      "end_ms": 135655,
      "text": "您说他算不算文人气象的第一块基石？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 136000,
      "end_ms": 136795,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137230,
      "end_ms": 138005,
      "text": "望江楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 138550,
      "end_ms": 143975,
      "text": "四川成都别的名楼写的都是士大夫升官治国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 144530,
      "end_ms": 147680,
      "text": "可这座楼里藏着的是一个才华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 147700,
      "end_ms": 150095,
      "text": "极高却一辈子命苦的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 150620,
      "end_ms": 153075,
      "text": "三十九米高整整四层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 153830,
      "end_ms": 155435,
      "text": "底下两层八个角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 155830,
      "end_ms": 157475,
      "text": "上面两层四个角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 158110,
      "end_ms": 163195,
      "text": "远远看过去全被一片绿油油的竹林包在里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 163920,
      "end_ms": 166515,
      "text": "清代文人为了纪念女诗人薛涛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 167280,
      "end_ms": 171415,
      "text": "专门盖了这座楼薛涛一辈子最喜欢竹子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 172140,
      "end_ms": 174615,
      "text": "当年他在这里亲手做信纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 175040,
      "end_ms": 176675,
      "text": "写了五百多首好诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 177200,
      "end_ms": 180275,
      "text": "跟白居易他们一起写诗喝酒聊天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 180660,
      "end_ms": 184020,
      "text": "可他空有一肚子惊人的才学身份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 184180,
      "end_ms": 186925,
      "text": "却只是个身不由己的卖艺女子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 187450,
      "end_ms": 189390,
      "text": "到老也是守着满院子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 189390,
      "end_ms": 194245,
      "text": "竹子一个人凄凄凉凉活到死楼修的再好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 194650,
      "end_ms": 195705,
      "text": "人早就没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 196230,
      "end_ms": 198765,
      "text": "但性质上当年滴下的眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 199190,
      "end_ms": 200905,
      "text": "到现在还让人揪心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 201380,
      "end_ms": 204255,
      "text": "这就是一代才女望不尽的委屈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 204610,
      "end_ms": 205395,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 205770,
      "end_ms": 206425,
      "text": "太白楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 206810,
      "end_ms": 209280,
      "text": "山东济宁全天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 209380,
      "end_ms": 211615,
      "text": "纪念诗仙的地方数都数不清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 212320,
      "end_ms": 218315,
      "text": "但这一座楼记录了李白最狂也最接地气的二十多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 218780,
      "end_ms": 221395,
      "text": "青砖灰瓦两层大屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 221880,
      "end_ms": 223075,
      "text": "屋里宽敞的很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 223780,
      "end_ms": 225345,
      "text": "看似平平常常，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 225960,
      "end_ms": 228915,
      "text": "底下枕着的可是京杭大运河的河水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 229390,
      "end_ms": 231410,
      "text": "当年李白在济宁安家落户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 231470,
      "end_ms": 232255,
      "text": "二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 232710,
      "end_ms": 234390,
      "text": "天天泡在这家小酒楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 234390,
      "end_ms": 237450,
      "text": "里端着大海碗喝酒喝高了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 237450,
      "end_ms": 241535,
      "text": "就在墙上狂写诗写下了整整五十多首好诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 241880,
      "end_ms": 245975,
      "text": "后来街坊邻居干脆把这家饭馆改名叫太白楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 246370,
      "end_ms": 247585,
      "text": "一千多年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 247970,
      "end_ms": 249725,
      "text": "不知多少考不上功名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 250340,
      "end_ms": 254845,
      "text": "心里堵得慌的书生特意跑来打上一脚烈酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 255230,
      "end_ms": 256985,
      "text": "靠着栏杆往前看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 257420,
      "end_ms": 258815,
      "text": "学李白的仙气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 259230,
      "end_ms": 261490,
      "text": "人走楼还在酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 261610,
      "end_ms": 267905,
      "text": "喝完了诗还在能在柴米油盐的小酒铺里把胸膛挺向天地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 268450,
      "end_ms": 270450,
      "text": "您说这算不算最烈的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 270450,
      "end_ms": 271370,
      "text": "一抹文人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 271430,
      "end_ms": 272025,
      "text": "骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 272410,
      "end_ms": 273065,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 273420,
      "end_ms": 275255,
      "text": "大观楼云南昆明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 275530,
      "end_ms": 278750,
      "text": "他就在滇池水边单看那两层木楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 278910,
      "end_ms": 280565,
      "text": "其实算不上多宏大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 281230,
      "end_ms": 284065,
      "text": "但他凭着一个穷书生写的一幅字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 284550,
      "end_ms": 289485,
      "text": "硬生生撑起了天下第一长联三间宽的门面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 290280,
      "end_ms": 291405,
      "text": "紧挨着水面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 292030,
      "end_ms": 293730,
      "text": "盖四周全是柳树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 294150,
      "end_ms": 298710,
      "text": "清朝乾隆年间一辈子没考上官的穷书生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 298770,
      "end_ms": 300750,
      "text": "孙然翁走上楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 301410,
      "end_ms": 303670,
      "text": "看着五百里滇池浪打浪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 304170,
      "end_ms": 308049,
      "text": "再回头想想千百年来历朝历代的兴衰变化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 308590,
      "end_ms": 313030,
      "text": "一口气在墙上写下一百八十个字的大长联前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 313070,
      "end_ms": 315050,
      "text": "半截写进了云南的大山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 315050,
      "end_ms": 320190,
      "text": "大水后半截把汉唐宋元那些大关将军的下场全说明白了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 320190,
      "end_ms": 323500,
      "text": "一个截的地峰应当想的布衣百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 324140,
      "end_ms": 326020,
      "text": "单凭手里一杆毛笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 326480,
      "end_ms": 327040,
      "text": "文采，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 327060,
      "end_ms": 331400,
      "text": "就压过了历代王爷大官的奉承画名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 331500,
      "end_ms": 332300,
      "text": "只是大官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 332840,
      "end_ms": 335720,
      "text": "胸膛里却装得下几百年历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 336440,
      "end_ms": 338700,
      "text": "这是何等的胸襟与做派。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 339120,
      "end_ms": 339900,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340340,
      "end_ms": 341220,
      "text": "鹳雀楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 341580,
      "end_ms": 344400,
      "text": "山西永济讲到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 344760,
      "end_ms": 347740,
      "text": "上级的分量就真正沉下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 348140,
      "end_ms": 350980,
      "text": "整整三层高楼七十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 350980,
      "end_ms": 352960,
      "text": "高高高高立在岸边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 353300,
      "end_ms": 355855,
      "text": "直冲冲盯着底下翻滚的黄河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 356340,
      "end_ms": 357825,
      "text": "一千三百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 358390,
      "end_ms": 361325,
      "text": "唐代诗人王之涣爬上这座楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 361820,
      "end_ms": 364815,
      "text": "看着天边的落日和滚滚黄河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 365290,
      "end_ms": 367515,
      "text": "只用了二十个大白话字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 368100,
      "end_ms": 369415,
      "text": "白日依山尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 369770,
      "end_ms": 370985,
      "text": "黄河入海流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 371440,
      "end_ms": 372745,
      "text": "欲穷千里目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 373220,
      "end_ms": 374385,
      "text": "更上一层楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 375050,
      "end_ms": 379495,
      "text": "就把中国文人登高望远的境界推到了顶峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 380050,
      "end_ms": 381265,
      "text": "后来的几百年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 381940,
      "end_ms": 383100,
      "text": "打仗的大火把，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 383100,
      "end_ms": 384245,
      "text": "它烧成焦土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 384860,
      "end_ms": 386870,
      "text": "滔滔黄河水几回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 386890,
      "end_ms": 388335,
      "text": "把地基冲的稀烂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 388940,
      "end_ms": 391975,
      "text": "唐朝的那座老楼连块砖头都没剩下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 392370,
      "end_ms": 394925,
      "text": "可哪怕楼没了整整七百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 395350,
      "end_ms": 396985,
      "text": "只要那二十个字还在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 397610,
      "end_ms": 400365,
      "text": "每一个中国人路过黄河边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 400780,
      "end_ms": 404035,
      "text": "脑子里就能立刻立起一座大唐的高楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 404450,
      "end_ms": 406595,
      "text": "木头盖的楼早晚会烧毁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 407040,
      "end_ms": 410645,
      "text": "唯有文人写下的诗能在大地上活一万年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00143",
      "start_ms": 411050,
      "end_ms": 412890,
      "text": "您说这算不算最硬的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00144",
      "start_ms": 412930,
      "end_ms": 415955,
      "text": "文人一锤从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00145",
      "start_ms": 416340,
      "end_ms": 419325,
      "text": "甲秀楼点醒了贵州的读书苗子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00146",
      "start_ms": 419990,
      "end_ms": 423185,
      "text": "望江楼藏着才女一世的叹气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00147",
      "start_ms": 423870,
      "end_ms": 426925,
      "text": "太白楼灌饱了李白满肚子的烈酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00148",
      "start_ms": 427500,
      "end_ms": 430785,
      "text": "大观楼用一百八十个字道破历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00149",
      "start_ms": 431240,
      "end_ms": 431960,
      "text": "鹳雀楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00150",
      "start_ms": 432000,
      "end_ms": 433755,
      "text": "哪怕被烧成焦土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00151",
      "start_ms": 434560,
      "end_ms": 438185,
      "text": "依然用二十个字撑起大唐门面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00152",
      "start_ms": 438820,
      "end_ms": 441655,
      "text": "可他们还不是最有文人气的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00153",
      "start_ms": 442200,
      "end_ms": 444605,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更不寻常。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00154",
      "start_ms": 445180,
      "end_ms": 448725,
      "text": "有一座楼历史上被大火烧光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00155",
      "start_ms": 449140,
      "end_ms": 451215,
      "text": "又重建了整整二十九次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00156",
      "start_ms": 452050,
      "end_ms": 454975,
      "text": "王勃当年靠着柱子写下的绝唱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00157",
      "start_ms": 455580,
      "end_ms": 458595,
      "text": "今天连一根旧木料都没留下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00158",
      "start_ms": 459340,
      "end_ms": 460440,
      "text": "有一座江边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00159",
      "start_ms": 460480,
      "end_ms": 463690,
      "text": "鼓楼引来几百位顶尖文豪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00160",
      "start_ms": 463850,
      "end_ms": 466175,
      "text": "在大墙上斗了一千多年的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00161",
      "start_ms": 466900,
      "end_ms": 468875,
      "text": "连李白都不敢轻易动笔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00162",
      "start_ms": 469470,
      "end_ms": 473885,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座写下千古名篇的大文豪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00163",
      "start_ms": 474230,
      "end_ms": 476730,
      "text": "一辈子连他的门槛都没迈过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00164",
      "start_ms": 476930,
      "end_ms": 477695,
      "text": "他是哪做？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00165",
      "start_ms": 478130,
      "end_ms": 482065,
      "text": "他凭什么能排在黄鹤楼和滕门阁的前头？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00166",
      "start_ms": 482480,
      "end_ms": 484545,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00167",
      "start_ms": 485180,
      "end_ms": 486720,
      "text": "现在直接点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00168",
      "start_ms": 486880,
      "end_ms": 487715,
      "text": "进入主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00169",
      "start_ms": 488210,
      "end_ms": 491375,
      "text": "第一条视频就是下一集点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0aec66ddf2b372c0_s00170",
      "start_ms": 491640,
      "end_ms": 495935,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国历史上最有文人气的名楼之首。"
    }
  ],
